  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Great Lakes Region Cross-Border Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Great Lakes Region Cross-Border Fund is a pooled funding mechanism that tackles cross-border aspects of peace and security. Its activities lead to improved trust and community building in affected areas, and facilitates improved coherence and coordination among United Nations organizations in the Great Lakes Region of Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
